# What Cloud Build must not upload.
#
# Without this the source archive is 244 MB, almost all of it web/node_modules,
# and every build pays to send it. `.gcloudignore` replaces gcloud's default of
# reading `.gitignore`, so anything that must stay out has to be named here even
# if git already ignores it.

.git/
.gitignore

# Installed, never shipped. The web image runs `npm ci` from the lockfile.
**/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/out/

# Python build and test residue.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Local state. `var/` holds the SQLite file a local run writes; it is not
# configuration and must never reach an image.
var/
*.db

# Local secrets. Cloud Run takes its configuration from the service definition
# and Secret Manager, never from a file in the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
